rsonality is real, and she meets a man that advises her watch her back.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cV4eDYyUfb9l39OvrJ9qn4B9vpk.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Heroine doesn't know which Ikki's personality is real, and she meets a man that advises her watch her back.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cV4eDYyUfb9l39OvrJ9qn4B9vpk.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9358","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50087","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"264532","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"30421","synopsis":"Heroine suddenly appears outside her apartment, and receives a text message from Kent, who says to meet up at the café. Heroine is confused by the conversation she has with Kent but plays along the best she can. Later at the café Kent figures out she has lost her memory.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/69qFOz1LAQxaQPAEJgEZWuGUG1Z.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Heroine suddenly appears outside her apartment, and receives a text message from Kent, who says to meet up at the café. Heroine is confused by the conversation she has with Kent but plays along the best she can. Later at the café Kent figures out she has lost her memory.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/69qFOz1LAQxaQPAEJgEZWuGUG1Z.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9358","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50087","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"264532","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"30420","synopsis":"Toma has been taking care of Heroine after she has passed out. Toma has continued to take care of her after a series of unknown threats. To lighten the mood they go shopping together and not long Heroine is approached by three angered girls.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9C7k7vNWG9Dua2TXOOwHDGU6eRe.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Toma has been taking care of Heroine after she has passed out. Toma has continued to take care of her after a series of unknown threats. To lighten the mood they go shopping together and not long Heroine is approached by three angered girls.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9C7k7vNWG9Dua2TXOOwHDGU6eRe.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9358","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50087","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"264532","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"30414","synopsis":"After the incident where the Heroine encountered Ikki's fan, she was isolated in Toma's house for few days. Every time she woke up, she received coffee from him until Orion showed up and explained that he put sleeping pills in her coffee. As they tried to escape, they found her phone, which contained many odd texts, but before they can leave, Shin shows up. She went back to bed and pretended to be asleep. However, it is revealed by Shin while arguing with Toma that he was not her boyfriend. After Shin leaves, Toma revealed his true motive to keep her here. He kisses her forcefully, making her swallow the drug and knock out. The next morning, she wakes up in a cage that he put her in if she tries escape from him. At night, Toma decides to let her out, and he explains that the reason he was doing it was to protect her from Ikki's fans. He puts her back in the cage after his professor calls him and tells him his data is incorrect in his report.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4n5UwSjpASYDg2c6eq3vwlQTsSP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"After the incident where the Heroine encountered Ikki's fan, she was isolated in Toma's house for few days. Every time she woke up, she received coffee from him until Orion showed up and explained that he put sleeping pills in her coffee. As they tried to escape, they found her phone, which contained many odd texts, but before they can leave, Shin shows up. She went back to bed and pretended to be asleep. However, it is revealed by Shin while arguing with Toma that he was not her boyfriend. After Shin leaves, Toma revealed his true motive to keep her here. He kisses her forcefully, making her swallow the drug and knock out. The next morning, she wakes up in a cage that he put her in if she tries escape from him. At night, Toma decides to let her out, and he explains that the reason he was doing it was to protect her from Ikki's fans. He puts her back in the cage after his professor calls him and tells him his data is incorrect in his report.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4n5UwSjpASYDg2c6eq3vwlQTsSP.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9358","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"15085","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50087","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"264532","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"30413","synopsis":"The Heroine finally arrives home, where she is able to open her diary by using her bobby pin where she sees that she had written that she loved Toma, and that on August the 1st was the day she had planned to tell him. Ikki knew of this. After the heroine had read it, Toma rushes in with an angered face. At first, he starts talking about how it was dangerous to go outside and how she kept \"running away\" from him. He moves in closer to her and notices her injuries. Toma tells her that since she did not know how his hurt heart felt, he would stop caring if she gets hurt too. Then he says, \"If I take all of you by force, you'll no longer see anything but me. Or will you break instead?\" The Heroine replies that she knows that he wouldn't do that. So, Toma asks, \"If I can't protect you, should I break you? I believe that I'll still love you, so...\" Seeing that the Heroine got afraid, he apologizes but says that he doesn't plan to let her hand go.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hiBDmKPC0vXxYCcpc12bAw4Chwc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"The Heroine finally arrives home, where she is able to open her diary by using her bobby pin where she sees that she had written that she loved Toma, and that on August the 1st was the day she had planned to tell him. Ikki knew of this. After the heroine had read it, Toma rushes in with an angered face. At first, he starts talking about how it was dangerous to go outside and how she kept \"running away\" from him. He moves in closer to her and notices her injuries. Toma tells her that since she did not know how his hurt heart felt, he would stop caring if she gets hurt too. Then he says, \"If I take all of you by force, you'll no longer see anything but me. Or will you break instead?\" The Heroine replies that she knows that he wouldn't 